          "text": "Hanyuma, jewe Daniyeli nca numva ncitse intege. Ndakumbagara, mara imisi myinshi ngwaye. Maze mu nyuma ndavyuka, nkora ibikorwa nari njejwe gukorera umwami. Ariko nari mbabajwe cane n’ivyo neretswe kuko ntashobora kwumva neza ivyo ari vyo.",
